# Words of Folders turning and resizing pictures, as reasons when it cannot.

## Pictures (src/files/imaging.rs)

# Reason shown when a picture of a kind that cannot be turned is turned.
folders-imaging-no-turn = Folders can only rotate JPEG, PNG, WebP and BMP pictures
# Why a link to a picture is not turned.
folders-imaging-no-turn-link = this is a link, so rotate the picture it points to instead
# Why a moving picture is not turned.
folders-imaging-no-turn-moving = Folders doesn't rotate animated pictures, because only the first frame would be kept
# Reason shown when a picture file could not be read for turning or resizing.
folders-imaging-unreadable = Folders couldn't read the picture
# Reason shown when a resized picture would have to be written in a kind Folders cannot write.
folders-imaging-no-write = Folders can't save this kind of picture
